OL,3,GNEWSALong-awaited bypass delayed again
OL,4,Adue to water main works
OL,5,
OL,6,FA long-awaited bypass will be delayed
OL,7,Ffor six months as water main diversion
OL,8,Fwork will push back its construction.
OL,10,FNorth Somerset Council has said Banwell
OL,11,FBypass will be set to open in the
OL,12,Fwinter of 2027 once Bristol Water has
OL,13,Frelocated its underground services from
OL,14,Fthe bypass construction area to make
OL,15,Fwater access easier for residents.
OL,17,FBuilding the bypass has cost more than
OL,18,F#105m and now the council has confirmed
OL,19,Fwater main work needs to be completed
OL,20,Ffirst as construction involves a range
OL,21,Fof ground improvements including
OL,22,Fpiling.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
