OL,3,GNEWSALong-awaited bypass delayed again
OL,4,Adue to water main works
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Mike Bell said the bypass
OL,7,Fwould improve road links between
OL,8,FWeston-super-Mare and the A38, helping
OL,9,Fjourneys flow smoothly on the wider
OL,10,Froad network.
